<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-164] Need to get rid of all mentions of gridgain in Ignite</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-164</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Just do a text search for the word &quot;gridgain&quot; in Ignite project and start replacing all &quot;gridgain&quot; references with &quot;ignite&quot; (make sure to keep the case).&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Also, when it comes to packages, &quot;org.gridgain&quot; text should be replaced with &quot;org.apache.ignite&quot;. For example, I still see log4j.xml having references to &quot;gridgain&quot;. &lt;/p&gt;</description>
